## Third-Party Notices

This software uses the following third-party components:

### Qt Framework

- License: GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL) v3
- Website: https://www.qt.io/
- Usage: GUI framework (Qt Core, Qt Gui, Qt Widgets)
- PhoenixRecover dynamically links against Qt libraries in compliance with
  the LGPL. Users may replace the Qt shared libraries with their own
  LGPL-compatible builds.

### FFmpeg

- License: GNU Lesser General Public License (LGPL) v2.1+ / GNU General
  Public License (GPL) v2+, depending on build configuration
- Website: https://ffmpeg.org/
- Usage: Video thumbnail extraction and MP4 remux (invoked as an independent
  external process; not statically or dynamically linked)
- PhoenixRecover calls the FFmpeg executable as a separate process for media
  operations. FFmpeg is not bundled with PhoenixRecover; users must obtain
  FFmpeg independently if they wish to use media-related features.
